@GridFlex.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7204

### System status

GET {{GridFlex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/status
Accept: application/json

### Liveness

GET {{GridFlex.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness

GET {{GridFlex.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Create control decision

POST {{GridFlex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/control/decision
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "stepNumber": 42,
  "elapsedTimeHours": 1.0,
  "intervalHours": 0.25,
  "generatedEnergyKwh": 5.0,
  "consumedEnergyKwh": 2.0,
  "netEnergyKwh": 3.0,
  "batteryStateOfChargeKwh": 10.0,
  "gridImportEnergyKwh": 0.0,
  "gridExportEnergyKwh": 0.0,
  "unresolvedEnergyKwh": 0.0
}

